{"title":"Asymptote: How to","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border:1px solid black; background:#CEE0F2;text-align:center;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#B0C4DE;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote_(Vector_Graphics_Language)\" title=\"Asymptote (Vector Graphics Language)\">Asymptote (Vector Graphics Language)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Getting_Started\" title=\"Asymptote: Getting Started\">Getting&#160;Started</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Basics\" title=\"Asymptote: Basics\">Basics</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Drawing\" title=\"Asymptote: Drawing\">Drawing</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Labeling\" title=\"Asymptote: Labeling\"> Labeling</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Filling\" title=\"Asymptote: Filling\"> Filling</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Useful_functions\" title=\"Asymptote: Useful functions\">Useful functions</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Useful_commands_and_their_Output\" title=\"Asymptote: Useful commands and their Output\">Examples</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Macros_and_Packages\" title=\"Asymptote: Macros and Packages\">Macros&#160;and&#160;Packages</a><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Help\" title=\"Asymptote: Help\">Help</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Reference\" title=\"Asymptote: Reference\">Reference</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Advanced\" title=\"Asymptote: Advanced\"> Advanced&#160;Asymptote</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=3D_graphics_for_Asymptote\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"3D graphics for Asymptote\">3D Graphics</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_CSE5\" title=\"Asymptote: CSE5\">CSE5 Package</a> - <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">How to</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Basics\">Basics</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_How_to&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Basics\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Drawing\" title=\"Asymptote: Drawing\">Drawing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Filling\" title=\"Asymptote: Filling\">Filling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Labeling\" title=\"Asymptote: Labeling\">Labeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Marking_Angles\" title=\"Asymptote: Marking Angles\">Marking Angles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Basics#Syntax\" title=\"Asymptote: Basics\">Using Asymptote on Aops Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_How_to&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Graphing\" title=\"Asymptote: Graphing\">Graphing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_Olympiad_Package_Part_1\" title=\"Asymptote: Olympiad Package Part 1\">Olympiad Package Basics</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced\">Advanced</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asymptote:_How_to&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Advanced\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018073857\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 second